## copy.NaN BSS 组件定位

## copy.copy BSS Component Location

BSS 作为运营组件，和 BSS-WEB 前端一起，提供界面给客户运维人员、交易员、清算岗、风控岗登陆使用相关运营业务管理功能。

As an operational component, BSS, together with the BSS-WEB front end, provides an interface for client operation and maintenance personnel, traders, clearing staff, and risk control staff to log in and use relevant operational business management functions.&#x20;



## copy.NaN DA 组件

## copy.copy DA Component

### copy.copy.1 组件定位

### copy.copy.copy Component Positioning

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-1.png>)

DA(Data Adapter)数据适配组件,负责将交易时所需交易所数据、券商数据，提前转换适配至HMS数据库及内存中，通常称之为上场。在盘中或盘后提供数据给柜台清算或监管系统使用，通常称之为下场功能。

DA (Data Adapter) data adaptation component is responsible for pre-converting and adapting the exchange data and brokerage data required during transactions to the HMS database and memory, which is commonly referred to as the "on-field" function. It provides data to the counter clearing or regulatory system during or after trading hours, which is commonly referred to as the "off-field" function.

### copy.copy.NaN 数据流

### copy.copy.copy Data Stream

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-2.png>)





## copy.NaN DP 组件定位

## copy.copy DP Component Positioning

DP 数据持久化服务，从 AMI 接收各种业务类型 memdb 主题消息的交易数据写入到数据库中。

DP Data Persistence Service receives transaction data of memdb topic messages of various business types from AMI and writes them into the database.

> DP 不能处理消息数据转换，比如字符串拼接、枚举转换、由 A 和 B 字段计算出C 字段值等，需要由内存表处理消息
>
> DP cannot handle message data conversion, such as string concatenation, enumeration conversion, calculating the value of field C from fields A and B, etc., and message processing needs to be handled by the memory table

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-3.png>)

