## copy.copy Database schema&#x20;

| 序号<br />Serial Number | 数据库功能说明<br />Database Function Description                                                                                                                                                                     | 数据库<br />Database          |
| --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |
|  1                    | 基础信息数据库（账户，持仓）<br />Basic Information Database (Accounts, Positions)                                                                                                                                           | hms\_basedb                |
| 2                     | 交易参数配置数据库&#xA;（交易相关的所有配置项，包括：交易日历，费用，交易时间段，等等）<br />Transaction Parameter Configuration Database&#xA;(All configuration items related to transactions, including: trading calendar, fees, trading hours, etc.) | hms\_tradingconfigdb<br /> |
| 3                     | 交易所信息库（交易所证券信息、证券参考信息）<br />Exchange Information Database (Exchange Securities Information, Securities Reference Information)                                                                                  | refdb                      |
| 4                     | 交易数据存储库（订单、成交响应、流水）<br />Transaction Data Repository (Orders, Execution Responses, Transaction Records)                                                                                                        | hms\_tradingdb             |
| 5                     | DP入库功能数据库<br />DP Incoming Database Function Database                                                                                                                                                          | hms\_dpconfigdb            |
| 6                     | DA上场功能数据库<br />DA Onstage Function Database                                                                                                                                                                    | hms\_importdb              |
| 7                     | DA下场功能数据库<br />DA Offline Function Database                                                                                                                                                                    | hms\_exportdb              |
| 8                     | 历史库<br />History Library                                                                                                                                                                                       | hms\_historydb             |
| 9                     | 运维功能库<br />Operation and Maintenance Function Library                                                                                                                                                          | operationdb                |
| 10                    | 用户功能库<br />User Function Library                                                                                                                                                                               | userdb                     |

