#### copy.copy.copy.NaN 柜台账户已卖空数量表（下发表）

#### copy.copy.copy.copy Table of Sold Short Quantity of Counter Accounts(Issued Below)

记录每个柜台账户的每个标的“已卖空数量”。&#x20;

Record the "shorted quantity" of each underlying for each counterparty account.&#x20;

* 当发生空头开仓时，增加“已卖空数量”

* When a short opening occurs, increase the "number of short sales"&#x20;

* 当发生空头平仓时，减少“已卖空数量”

* When a short position is closed, reduce the "number of short sales"&#x20;

