#### copy.copy.copy.1 现货调度管理

#### copy.copy.copy.copy Spot Scheduling Management

数据库表：t\_biz\_param

Database Table: t\_biz\_param

| **name**                                   | **key**                    | value                                                         | **description**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 卖出现货调度模式<br />Spot Selling Scheduling Mode | SpotSaleDispatchMode<br /> | 1-使用全部账户柜台持仓<br />1 - Use all account counter positions<br /> | 0-仅使用本账户柜台持仓，卖出只能使用多头交易绑定柜台账户持仓，不支持卖空业务；&#xA;1-使用全部账户柜台持仓，卖出和卖空时可使用其他柜台账户持仓；<br />0 - Only use the counter positions of this account. When selling, only the counter positions of the long trading-bound counter account can be used, and short selling is not supported;&#xA;1 - Use the counter positions of all accounts. When selling and short selling, the counter positions of other counter accounts can be used; |

#### copy.copy.copy.NaN 召回管理（V1.1）

#### copy.copy.copy.copy Recall Management (V1.1)

数据库表：t\_biz\_param

Database Table: t\_biz\_param

| **name**                                                   | **key**         | value         | **description**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
| ---------------------------------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 强制召回模式<br />Forced Recall Mode<br />                       | recall\_mode    | <br />1<br /> | 0-不支持召回：不进行召回，底仓不足则拒单；&#xA;1-敞口管理账户兜底召回：如果底仓不足则敞口管理账户兜底；&#xA;2-全部账户召回：底仓不足时，进入召回处理流程<br />0 - Recall Not Supported: No recall is performed; if the base position is insufficient, the order will be rejected.&#xA;1 - Fallback Recall by Open Position Management Account: If the base position is insufficient, the open position management account will provide fallback support.&#xA;2 - Recall from All Accounts: When the base position is insufficient, the recall processing procedure will be initiated. |
| 强制召回金额下限<br />Lower limit of mandatory recall amount<br /> | RecallMinAmount | 200<br />     | 当底仓数量不足需要强制召回时，为了减少召回的次数，设置召回金额下限，低于下限时不召回。可设置非负整数。<br />When the number of underlying positions is insufficient and forced recall is required, to reduce the number of recalls, a lower limit for the recall amount is set, and no recall will be made if it is below this limit. A non-negative integer can be set.                                                                                                                                                                                             |

#### copy.copy.copy.NaN 虚拟成交参数管理（V1.1）

#### copy.copy.copy.copy Virtual Transaction Parameter Management (V1.1)

数据库表：t\_biz\_param

Database Table: t\_biz\_param

| **name**                                              | **key**                          | value（默认出厂）<br />value (default factory setting) | **description**                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 零碎股虚拟成交开关<br />Odd Lots Virtual Trading Switch        | odd\_lot\_virtual\_trade\_switch | 1<br />                                          | 0-禁用：不处理撮合；&#xA;1-启用：按撮合成交方式处理撮合<br />0 - Disabled: Do not process matching;&#xA;1 - Enabled: Process matching according to the matching and trading method                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| 零碎股撮合成交模式<br />Odd Lots Matching Transaction Model    | odd\_lot\_matching\_mode<br />   | 1<br />                                          | 1-直接撮合：不管实盘的委托价格与盘口数量，按委托价格等于成交价格指定价格撮合两笔成对的订单。&#xA;2-行情撮合：根据Level1行情情况进行撮合，需要委托价格和行情价格匹配。<br />1 - Direct Matching: Regardless of the order price and quantity in the real market, match two paired orders at a specified price where the order price equals the transaction price.&#xA;2 - Market Matching: Match based on the Level 1 market conditions, requiring the order price to match the market price. |
| 召回虚拟成交开关<br />Recall Virtual Deal Switch              | recall\_virtual\_trade\_switch   | 1                                                | 0-禁用：不处理撮合；&#xA;1-启用：按撮合成交方式处理撮合<br />0 - Disabled: Do not process matching;&#xA;1 - Enabled: Process matching according to the matching and trading method                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| 召回撮合成交模式<br />Recall Matching Transaction Mode <br /> | recall\_matching\_mode<br />     | 1<br />                                          | 1-直接撮合：不管实盘的委托价格与盘口数量，按委托价格等于成交价格指定价格撮合两笔成对的订单。&#xA;2-行情撮合：根据Level1行情情况进行撮合，需要委托价格和行情价格匹配。<br />1 - Direct Matching: Regardless of the order price and quantity in the real market, match two paired orders at a specified price where the order price equals the transaction price.&#xA;2 - Market Matching: Match based on the Level 1 market conditions, requiring the order price to match the market price. |

