| 查询指令<br />Query Instruction                | 查询<br />Query                |                          | POST                     |                                                      |
| 控制指令<br />Control Instruction              | 新增<br />Newly Added          |                          | POST                     |                                                      |
| 控制指令<br />Control Instruction              | 修改<br />Modify               |                          | POST                     |                                                      |
| 控制指令<br />Control Instruction              | 删除<br />Delete               |                          | POST                     |                                                      |

目前仅支持接入用户跟对冲账户之间建立关联关系

Currently only supports establishing an association relationship between the connected user and the hedging account

1. 新增：原先接入用户主体数据依旧采用发送实时指令的方式，接入用户跟对冲账户关联关系采用修改source表的方式

2. New addition: The original connected user entity data will still be processed by sending real-time instructions, while the associated relationship between connected users and hedging accounts will be modified by updating the source table.

3. 修改：保持原先逻辑不变，接入用户跟对冲账户关联关系采用先删除source表的数据再插入的方式

4. Modification: Keep the original logic unchanged. The method of first deleting data from the source table and then inserting it is used to connect the association relationship between users and hedging accounts.

5. 删除：保持原先逻辑不变，接入用户跟对冲账户关联关系采用删除source表的数据的方式

6. Deletion: Keep the original logic unchanged, and use the method of deleting data from the source table to connect the user's association relationship with the hedging account

