**背景：**

**Background:&#x20;**

自营柜台受限持仓字段（current\_restricted\_qty）同步方案，采取调用自营的运营HTTP API接口的方式获取数据

Synchronization plan for the restricted position field (current\_restricted\_qty) of the proprietary trading counter,  which obtains data by calling the proprietary trading's operational HTTP API interface&#x20;

|                                                            | 实现方案<br />Implementation Plan                                                                                                                               | 改造点<br />Transformation Point                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | 备注<br />Remarks                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 方案一<br />Option 1<br />（使用此方案）<br />(Use this plan) <br /> | 通过对冲台 BSS 调用自营柜台的运营 API 股份查询接口<br />Call the operation API stock query interface of the proprietary trading counter through the hedging platform BSS <br /> | 自营 BSS：提供运营 API 接口，维护对冲台运营 API 接口调用用户<br />Self-operated BSS: Provides operational API interfaces and maintains users who call the hedging counter operational API interfaces<br />对冲台 BSS：实现登录+调用查询接口<br />Hedging Platform BSS: Implement Login + Call Query Interface  | 需要柜台在 V4.2.9 版本上，规划版本实现&#xA;拉通对冲台和自营柜台的客户侧 IT 负责人<br />The counter needs to be on version V4.2.9, and the planning version is implemented.&#xA;Customer-side IT person in charge of pulling through hedging tables and self-operated counters<br /> |
| ~~方案二~~<br />~~Option 2~~                                  | ~~通过对冲台 HTE 调用自营柜台的 Trade API 接口查询~~<br />~~Query through the Trade API interface of the proprietary trading counter called by the hedging platform HTE~~   | ~~BSS：发送查询指令给 HTE~~<br />~~BSS: Send a query command to HTE ~~<br />~~HTE：调用柜台 TradeAPI 查询 current\_restricted\_qty 股份并返回给 BSS ~~<br />~~HTE: Call the counter TradeAPI to query the current\_restricted\_qty stock and return it to BSS~~                                |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |



