### copy.copy.copy In-memory database http interface&#x20;

参考 ： [ OSS运维管理系统概要设计](https://archforce.feishu.cn/wiki/AxiOwWLpzidMJhkRkKZcfDuMnjd#share-Zf6cdxdTfoJ9PXx9mTtcE4Z0nwg)&#x20;

Reference: [ Outline Design of OSS Operation and Maintenance Management System](https://archforce.feishu.cn/wiki/AxiOwWLpzidMJhkRkKZcfDuMnjd#share-Zf6cdxdTfoJ9PXx9mTtcE4Z0nwg)&#x20;

> **不同高可用场景下请求形态如下：**
>
> **The request patterns under different high availability scenarios are as follows:&#x20;**
>
> * 主备集群：直接发http请求到主节点；（**HTE 使用此部署方式**）； 是否区分查询走备实例，控制（新增、修改、删除）走主实例
>
> * Primary and standby cluster: directly send http requests to the master node; ( **HTE uses this deployment method&#x20;**); whether to distinguish query standby instances, control (add, modify, delete) go to the master instance
>
> * 主从集群：直接发http请求到主集群的主实例；
>
> * Master-slave cluster: Send HTTP requests directly to the master instance of the master cluster;
>
> * 多活集群：http分别请求到多个实例；
>
> * Multi-active cluster: HTTP requests are sent to multiple instances respectively;
>
> **主备信息获取：**
>
> **Primary and standby information acquisition:**
>
> * 主备信息从组件探活时，内存计算服务的结果中获取；
>
> * The primary and standby information is obtained from the results of the memory computing service during component liveness detection;&#x20;
>
> * ~~{ip}:{端口} 从 OSS 的 CMDB（配置管理数据库） 中获取；~~
>
> * ~~{ip}:{port} is obtained from OSS's CMDB (Configuration Management Database);~~
>
> **内存服务要求：**
>
> **Memory Service Requirements:**
>
> * 内存服务对外提供 http 运维接口，并遵循标准的接口规范
>
> * The memory service provides external HTTP operation and maintenance interfaces and adheres to standard interface specifications&#x20;



#### copy.copy.copy.1 **执行 sql 查询和更新(实时查询和控制指令)**

#### copy.copy.copy.copy **Execute SQL queries and updates (real-time queries and control commands)**

##### copy.copy.copy.copy.1 接口封装设计

##### copy.copy.copy.copy.copy Interface Encapsulation Design



![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-9.png>)

1. 基础 DTO 定义

2. Basic DTO Definition

   * `SqlRequest`：入参记录类

   * `SqlRequest`: Input parameter record class

   * `ApiResponse`：带泛型的统一响应结构

   * `ApiResponse`: Unified response structure with generics

   * 使用Java 21的 record 特性实现不可变数据传输对象

   * Implementing Immutable Data Transfer Objects Using Java 21's Record Feature

3. HTTP 客户端配置

4. HTTP Client Configuration

   * 使用虚拟线程执行器（`Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()`）

   * Use the virtual thread executor (`Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor()`)&#x20;

   * 全局单例HttpClient实例，符合最佳实践

   * Global singleton HttpClient instance, conforming to best practices

5. 服务层封装

6. Service Layer Encapsulation

   * 接口与实现分离，符合开闭原则

   * Separation of interface and implementation adheres to the Open Closed Principle

   * 使用 Jackson 进行 JSON 序列化

   * Use Jackson for JSON serialization

   * 异常处理，返回标准错误格式

   * Exception handling, returning a standard error format

7. 单节点事务处理

8. Single-node transaction processing

   > 实时生效前提：HTE 启动
   >
   > Prerequisite for real-time effectiveness: HTE is started

   先操作数据库、再操作内存库  ； 再提交整个事务                     &#x20;

   First operate on the database, then operate on the memory database; then submit the entire transaction&#x20;

   1. 场景一： 数据库更新成功，指令失败； 要想内存生效，重复添加会提示数据库主键重复

   2. Scenario 1: Database update succeeded, but the command failed; to make the memory effective, repeating the addition will prompt a duplicate database primary key error

   3. 场景二：内存库操作失败，数据库需要回滚

   4. Scenario 2: Memory bank operation failed, and the database needs to be rolled back

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-10.png>)

* 异常处理

* Exception Handling

指令处理结果和数据库更新不在同一事务

Instruction processing results and database updates are not in the same transaction

* 其它注意事项

* Other Notes

  * SQL 注入风险； 应用层

  * SQL injection risk; Application layer

  * 加密、脱敏

  * Encryption, Desensitization

  * 性能：限流机制（如 Semaphore）

  * Performance: Rate Limiting Mechanism (e.g., Semaphore)

  * 鉴权和路由

  * Authentication and Routing

  * 安全：删除、DDL、大批量修改

  * Security: Delete, DDL, Mass Modification

  * 请求重试机制

  * Request Retry Mechanism

  * 审计日志：SQL 打印、操作人、执行耗时

  * Audit Log: SQL Print, Operator, Execution Time&#x20;

  * 批量操作使用事务

  * Batch operations use transactions

