### copy.copy.NaN **业务指令 http 接口**

### copy.copy.copy **Business Instruction HTTP Interface**

> **注：HTTP请求只需要关注订单是否被TE内部处理，对于交易所拒单由TE直接推送给DP落库，按DP正常订单流程处理**
>
> **Note: HTTP requests only need to focus on whether the order has been processed internally by TE. For orders rejected by the exchange, TE will directly push them to DP for database storage and process them according to DP's normal order process.**

