#### copy.copy.copy.NaN **~~请求和响应落库表~~（使用日志记录）**

#### copy.copy.copy.copy **~~Request and Response Database Table ~~ (Using Logging)&#x20;**

记录 BSS 实时指令、委托的原始请求和响应体，便于记录原始数据和分析问题

Record the original requests and response bodies of BSS real-time instructions and commissions to facilitate the recording of raw data and problem analysis



#### copy.copy.copy.NaN **业务http指令开发说明**

#### copy.copy.copy.copy **Business HTTP Instruction Development Instructions**

* 请求数据可以为任何的 json

* The requested data can be any JSON&#x20;

* 如果对接的组件使用 MP 协议，对于实时指令开发可以根据 MP 协议的 XML 定义 java 侧的数据结构来做业务参数交换，对接组件需要提供 json2map 的能力，能够把请求 json 转换为对应的业务消息来处理；

* If the connected component uses the MP protocol, for real-time instruction development, the data structure on the Java side can be defined according to the XML of the MP protocol to perform business parameter exchange. The connected component needs to provide the ability of json2map, which can convert the requested JSON into the corresponding business message for processing;&#x20;

  > 比如通过http请求下单，BSS开发需要根据XML定义订单的数据结构，通过前端交互把数据填写到数据结构中并转为JSON，通过http请求到网关，网关需要根据inst\_type解析JSON映射射到对应的MP对象；
  >
  > For example, when placing an order via an HTTP request, BSS development needs to define the data structure of the order according to XML, fill the data into the data structure through front-end interaction and convert it to JSON, and then send it to the gateway via an HTTP request. The gateway needs to parse the JSON according to the inst\_type and map it to the corresponding MP object;&#x20;

* 如果对接组件使用HSP协议，对于实时指令开发可以根据HSP协议的json定义java侧的数据结构来做业务参数交换，对接组件需要提供json2jhsp的能力，能够把请求json转换为对应的业务消息来处理；

* If the docking component uses the HSP protocol, for real-time instruction development, the data structure on the Java side can be defined according to the JSON of the HSP protocol to perform business parameter exchange. The docking component needs to provide the json2jhsp capability, which can convert the request JSON into the corresponding business message for processing;&#x20;



### copy.copy.NaN 一户两地(V1.0.1)

### copy.copy.copy One Household, Two Locations (V1.0.1)

一户两地 ：单账户双节点部署能力； 支持一户两地模式, 就近对接本地的交易柜台与对冲台,支持数据跨节点通信

One Account, Two Locations: Single-account, dual-node deployment capability; supports the one account, two locations model, enabling nearby connection to local trading desks and hedging desks, and supporting cross-node data communication

