#### copy.copy.copy.copy Counter Channel (no change)

目前支持华锐自营柜台

Currently supports Huarui's self-operated counter

注意：柜台账户在每个市场对应唯一的通道。当柜台通道不指定市场时，说明该通道可用于全部市场

Note: The counter account corresponds to a unique channel in each market. When the counter channel does not specify a market, it indicates that the channel can be used for all markets.

