#### copy.copy.copy.NaN **外部交易和查询的校验和路由规则（不涉及 BOS）**

#### copy.copy.copy.copy **Checksum and routing rules for external transactions and queries (not involving BOS)**

| **请求分类**<br />**Request Classification** | **消息经过组件路径**<br />**Message passes through component path**                                                                                                                                       | **校验和路由规则**<br />**Checksum and Routing Rules**                                                                                                                                     |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 委托<br />entrust<br />                    | 外部（交易台） -->  网关模块<br />External (trading desk) --> Gateway module                                                                                                                                 | 基于传入市场判断分区是否匹配，不匹配则拒单<br />Based on the incomingmarketto determine whether the partition matches; if not, reject the order                                                          |
|                                          |                                   网关模块 -> 交易引擎 -> 报盘模块<br />                                 Gateway Module -> Trading Engine -> Order Submission Module                                          | 无需路由，同分区处理<br />No routing required, processed within the same partition                                                                                                            |
|                                          |                                                                             报盘模块 --> 柜台<br />                                                                           Offer Module --> Counter  | 基于【柜台账户&市场】，得到【柜台通道】，路由到该柜台通道处理交易上报<br />Based on the \[Counter Account & Market], obtain the \[ Counter Channel ], and route to the counter channel to process transaction reports |
| 查询<br />Query                            | 外部（交易台） --> 网关模块<br />External (trading desk) --> Gateway Module                                                                                                                                  | 不校验市场和分区是否一致，都受理查询<br />Does not verify whether the market and partition are consistent, and accepts all queries                                                                    |
|                                          |                                   网关模块->查询引擎<br />                                 Gateway Module -> Query Engine                                                                                 | 无需路由，同分区处理<br />No routing required, processed within the same partition                                                                                                            |



