##### copy.copy.copy.copy.NaN 路由处理

##### copy.copy.copy.copy.copy Route Processing

> BSS 配置：市场 和 domainserver 实例 的 IP 映射关系; 北交所和沪市同一路由
>
> BSS Configuration: IP mapping relationship between market and domainserver instances; North Exchange and Shanghai Stock Exchange share the same route
>
> HTE：订单相关编号需要按不同市场分段，避免落库 DP 主键冲突
>
> HTE: Order-related numbers need to be segmented by different markets to avoid conflicts in the primary key of the DP when stored in the database

1. BSS 通过 DomainServer 的 ETCD 服务配置获取 HTE 实例 IP（包含两种网卡） 、是否主实例和 端口信息 （配置参数：etcd.address）&#x20;

2. BSS obtains HTE instance IP (including two types of network cards), whether it is the primary instance, and port information through the ETCD service configuration of DomainServer (configuration parameter: etcd.address)&#x20;

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-image-6.png>)

* 按配置过滤需要按市场路由的业务 （配置参数：http.execute.message.routing.market-base-routing-msg-type-ids）

* Filter services that need to be routed by market according to configuration (configuration parameter: http.execute.message.routing.market-base-routing-msg-type-ids)

  * 委托：按市场路由； 消息号： 100002

  * Entrustment: Route by market; Message number: 100002&#x20;

  * 持仓实时调整：按证券市场路由； 消息号： 800001、800002、800003

  * Real-time position adjustment: routed by the securities market; Message numbers: 800001, 800002, 800003

  * 其它实时指令：两个 HTE 主实例都发

  * Other real-time instructions: Both HTE primary instances send

* 只往主实例 IP （管理 IP列表）发送 http 实时指令 （配置参数 ：hte.network.manage.ip）

* Only send http real-time commands to the primary instance IP  (management IP list)  (configuration parameter: hte.network.manage.ip)&#x20;

Post 请求框架会把发往主实例的委托和实时指令、SQL ，复制给备

The Post Request Framework will copy the delegations, real-time instructions, and SQL statements sent to the primary instance to the standby instance.&#x20;

* 异常事务处理

* Abnormal Transaction Handling

  1. &#x20; HTE 未启动，只修改数据库，无异常提醒

  2. &#x20;HTE is not started, only the database is modified, and there is no abnormal alert&#x20;

  * 两个中心都未启动，只修改数据库

  * Neither of the two centers has been started, only the database is modified

  * 只有一个中心启动，只改启动成功的内存数据库，~~同时修改数据库成功；~~ 前端提示：xx 集群分组，内存处理失败，另外一个中心跳过处理

  * Only one center is started, and only the in-memory database that has been successfully started is modified;~~meanwhile, the database modification is successful;~~Front-end prompt: Memory processing failed for xx cluster group;another center skips processing

  - HTE 启动正常

  - HTE starts normally

  * 成功：所有中心都返回成功

  * Success: All centers returned success&#x20;

  * 任一中心内存处理失败，前端提示：xx 集群分组，内存处理失败&#x20;

  * Any central memory processing failure,  Front-end prompt: xx cluster grouping,  Memory processing failure&#x20;

  方案一（采用此方案）：视双中心的内存处理和数据库处理为同一个事务， 处理成功的内存无法回滚，数据库也回滚；

  Option 1 (adopt this option): Treat the memory processing and database processing of the dual centers as the same transaction. Memory that has been successfully processed cannot be rolled back, while the database can be rolled back;

  优势：前端所见即所得原则 ；即客户

  Advantages: Front-end WYSIWYG principle; i.e., the client

  修改：可以继续发起修改

  Modify: You can continue to initiate modifications&#x20;

  新增：处理成功的中心会提示异常

  New: Centers with successful processing will prompt an exception

  方案二：内存处理和数据库处理独立，不回滚；

  Option 2: Memory processing and database processing are independent, without rollback;

  * 两个中心都处理失败，数据库回滚

  * Both centers failed to process, and the database was rolled back

* 应急场景

* Emergency Scenario

  * 只修改单一中心，走 OSS 应急修改实例内存表

  * Only modify a single center, and follow the OSS emergency modification instance memory table

