### copy.copy.NaN 文件清理

### copy.copy.copy File Cleanup

**t\_file\_clean\_archive\_config**

补充说明：

Supplementary Note:&#x20;

* 归档文件包格式：yyyy-mm-dd/组件实例名\_yyyy-mm-dd\_-HH:mm:ss\_系统自增id.tgz

* Archived file package format: yyyy-mm-dd/ComponentInstanceName\_yyyy-mm-dd\_-HH:mm:ss\_SystemAutoIncrementID.tgz

* OSS调用AGENT执行压缩接口为同步接口，超时时间3分钟，支持配置

* The OSS call to the AGENT to execute the compression interface is a synchronous interface with a timeout of 3 minutes and supports configuration&#x20;

* AGENT压缩方法为串行执行，使用synchronize对方法加锁处理，避免并行风险

* The AGENT compression method is executed serially, using synchronize to lock the method to avoid parallel risks&#x20;

* 模板中间清理归档失败，不立马停止任务，组内全部执行完成后给出明细结果

* Template intermediate cleanup and archiving failed, do not immediately stop the task, and provide detailed results after all tasks within the group are completed

| 备注<br />Remarks<br />                   | config\_group<br />文件清理归档组<br />Document Cleaning and Archiving Group | component\_name<br />组件名,按照部署组件进行全部处理<br />Component name, fully processed according to the deployed components<br /> | 归档源路径<br />Archiving Source Path<br /> |  归档目标路径<br /> Archive Destination Path  | 需要过滤的参数、逗号分隔<br />Parameters to be filtered, comma-separated<br />文件：配置.后缀<br />File: config.suffix<br />文件夹：文件夹前需要有 ./ 按照linux的—exclude方式配置<br />Folder:./ must be added before the folder and configured according to the --exclude method of Linux | 操作类型：<br />Operation Type:<br />1=归档<br />1=Archived<br />2=清理<br />2 = Clean<br />3=清理&&归档 <br />3=Cleanup && Archiving <br />默认3<br />Default 3 | 保留天数，建议保留7天在归档防止归档时数据继续写入，导致归档失败<br />Retention days: It is recommended to retain for 7 days during archiving to prevent data from continuing to be written during archiving, which could lead to archiving failure |
