### copy.copy.NaN 对冲台运营 API设计（V1.2）

### copy.copy.copy Hedging Platform Operation  API Design (V1.2)&#x20;

### copy.copy.NaN 历史查询设计（V1.2.1）

### copy.copy.copy Historical Query Design (V1.2.1)

跟自营的差异：对冲台没有历史路由表

Differences from self-operated: The hedging desk does not have a historical routing table&#x20;

设计要点：
1.获取历史表名称

Design Highlights:
1\. Obtain the name of the historical table

2.历史表数据过多时，会进行分表，对冲台没有路由表的话需要重新设计如何根据查询条件里面的备份日期获取对应的历史表

2\. When there is too much data in the historical table, table partitioning will be performed. If the hedging platform does not have a routing table, it is necessary to redesign how to obtain the corresponding historical table based on the backup date in the query conditions.

3.目前大表查询框架不支持没有路由表的历史数据查询，需要修改框架

3\. Currently, the large table query framework does not support querying historical data without a routing table, and the framework needs to be modified.

