### copy.copy.NaN DP 自主进行主备切换事件判断（V1.2）

### copy.copy.copy DP autonomously conducts event judgment for active-standby switchover (V1.2)

**背景：**&#x5BF9;冲台 DP **写库跟不上消息接收**，**DP**应用消息队列满时，接收线程被阻塞，在**主副本**发生故障时，**备副本**转不了主改造方案

**Background:&#x20;**&#x48;edging station DP **write library can not keep up with message reception&#x20;**, **DP&#x20;**&#x61;pplication message queue is full, the receiving thread is blocked, when the **primary replica&#x20;**&#x66;ails, the **standby replica&#x20;**&#x63;an not be converted to the main transformation scheme

补充： AMI 和  ETCD 的机制 、配置

Supplementary: Mechanisms and configurations of AMI and ETCD&#x20;



**方案改造**如下：

**The program transformation&#x20;**&#x20;is as follows:&#x20;

1. 应用添加是否阻塞状态字段
   &#x20;   接收线程
   &#x20;     &#x20;**&#x20;阻塞时(队列长度>=应用配置长度时)** 是否阻塞状态 更新是否阻塞状态 true&#x20;
   &#x20;       **非阻塞时(队列长度<应用配置长度时)** 是否阻塞状态 更新是否阻塞状态 false&#x20;

2. Application addition blocking status field
   &#x20;   Receiving thread
   &#x20;     &#x20;**&#x20;When blocked (queue length >= application configuration length)&#x20;**&#x20;Blocking status Update blocking status to true&#x20;**&#x20;When non-blocking (queue length < application configuration length)&#x20;**&#x20;Blocking status Update blocking status to false&#x20;

3. 定时任务

4. Scheduled Task&#x20;

   * 10 秒执行一次（默认出厂修改为 1 秒）

   * Executed once every 10 seconds (default factory setting modified to 1 second)

   * 检查**当前dp副本**当前处于  **阻塞状态** 且为 **节点备状态**？

   * Check**if the current dp copy**is currently in the**blocked state**and is in the**node standby state**?&#x20;

   * 如果**是**：etcd 查询 当前Context的在domainServer 的 **Arb仲裁** 是否为**主**？

   * If&#x20;**&#x20;is&#x20;**: etcd queries whether the&#x20;**&#x20;Arb arbitration&#x20;**&#x20;of the current Context on the domainServer is&#x20;**&#x20;primary&#x20;**?&#x20;

   * 当前DP副本**Arb仲裁**为主时，执行转主操作

   * Current DP Replic&#x61;**&#x20;Arb Arbitration&#x20;**&#x20;When it is the primary, perform the primary transfer operation&#x20;

5. Nacos DP 组件参数配置？&#x20;

6. Nacos DP Component Parameter Configuration?&#x20;

**影响域**

**Impact Domain**

本次不影响现有功能。

This time, it will not affect existing functions.&#x20;

旨在修复备:DP主节点写库更不上消息接收，内存队列堆满，触发接收线程发生堵塞，主节点宕机，备节点也处于原主节点状态（内存队列堆满，触发接收线程发生堵塞状态，无法接收事件不能转主）。

aims to fix the standby: the DP primary node fails to keep up with message reception when writing to the database, the memory queue fills up, triggering blockage of the receiving thread, the primary node experiences downtime, and the standby node also enters the same state as the original primary node (the memory queue fills up, triggering blockage of the receiving thread, unable to receive events and unable to switch to the primary state).&#x20;

改动：定时任务秒执行一次，检查当前 dp 副本是否处于阻塞状态且为节点备状态，是查询 etcd 当前 Context 在 domainServer 的 Arb 仲裁是否为主，当前 DP 副本 Arb 仲裁为主时，执行转主操作

Change: The scheduled task is executed once per second to check whether the current DP replica is in a blocked state and in the standby state of the node. If so, query whether the current Context in etcd's Arb arbitration in the domainServer is the primary. When the Arb arbitration of the current DP replica is the primary, perform the operation of switching to the primary.



**测试复现场景：**

**Test reproduction scenario:**

修改application.properties配置文件 配置dp.batch.size 调整1

Modify the application.properties configuration file, configure dp.batch.size, and adjust it to 1

测试 发单速率大于 1000tps, 构造写库跟不上消息接收，堆满缓存队列场景

Test the scenario where the order issuance rate exceeds 1000 tps, causing the write library to fail to keep up with message reception and fill up the cache queue

通过在domainServer  dp\_1\_11\_11 监控界面 Rx 主题收消息数没有增加（触发接收线程发生堵塞状态）

By monitoring the Rx topic on the domainServer dp\_1\_11\_11 monitoring interface, the number of received messages has not increased (triggering the receiving thread to enter a blocked state)&#x20;

此时kill主节点dp\_1\_11\_11进程，

At this time, kill the process of the master node dp\_1\_11\_11,

观测备节点dp\_1\_11\_12日志是否转成主(isMaster:true)，是否正常写库（检查数据库表数据是否增加）

Check if the log of standby node dp\_1\_11\_12 has been converted to master (isMaster: true), and if it is writing to the database normally (check if the data in the database table has increased)&#x20;





