## copy.NaN 高可用

## copy.copy High Availability

![](<images/对冲交易平台_BOS 概要设计-diagram-15.png>)



负载均衡：keepalived + nginx ，虚拟IP（VIP）漂移和健康检查机制，确保当主 Nginx 节点故障时，备用节点能迅速接管服务，从而实现服务的高可用性

Load balance: keepalived + nginx, virtual IP (VIP) drift and health check mechanism, ensuring that when the primary Nginx node fails, the standby node can quickly take over the service, thereby achieving high availability of the service

Ngnix : 考虑 BSS 在机构和自营场景并发不高，nginx 使用 backup 模式，方便只查主实例排查问题

Ngnix: Considering that the concurrency of BSS in institutional and proprietary trading scenarios is not high, nginx uses the backup mode to facilitate troubleshooting by only checking the primary instance

DA 和 DP 高可用见架构设计

High availability of DA and DP is described in the architecture design

DP 重试机制：数据库不可用&#x20;

DP Retry Mechanism: Database Unavailable





> DA 部署方案：多活
>
> DA Deployment Plan: Multi-active

