| 1                        | 框架的 Http 接口会话鉴权<br />Http Interface Session Authentication of the Framework<br />                          | 已解决<br />Resolved      | 内存服务和BSS约定一个token，BSS请求时token加到请求头中，内存服务比对token是否一致<br />The memory service and BSS agree on a token. When BSS makes a request, the token is added to the request header, and the memory service compares whether the token is consistent.  |
